There is at present no direct way to compare inverseSystem(d, inverseSystem M)
and M, since the matrices representing these submodules are really representing
sets of generators in D^r. However, we can check equality of containment by
applying inverseSystem again:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i26 : M = random(S^{0,1}, S^{-1,-1,-2,-2})                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o26 = {0}  | -15a-49c                    39a+33b-33c                         |
|      {-1} | -20a2+9ab-8b2-26ac-3bc+16c2 44a2-39ab+43b2+22ac-22bc-28c2       |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
