fromDividedPowers -- Translates from divided power monomial basis to ordinary monomial basis
********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        f1 = fromDividedPowers f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
      * f, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 
  * Outputs:
      * f1, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
      * f1, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 

Description
===========

If f is a polynomial, or a matrix of polynomials, written in the divided power
monomial basis, then f1 is the corresponding object written in the ordinary
monomial basis.

+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[x,y]                 |
|                                     |
|o1 = S                               |
|                                     |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                  |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : x^2 == fromDividedPowers (2*x^2)|
|                                     |
|o2 = true                            |
+-------------------------------------+

