Caveat
======

Because inverseSystem involves a conversion between the bases of the dual, it
should not be used in the default mode unless the characteristic is greater
than the highest degree to which a variable appears. To make $x^a$ represent
$x^{(a)}$, for example in small characteristics use

inverseSystem(Matrix, DividedPowers=>true)

(which was the default behavior of the old script "fromDual").

